---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Network from '../components/Network.astro';
---
<Layout title="Building businesses around problems worth solving" description="Tarian Ventures is a founder-led home for researching, testing and piloting ideas. Current work includes Tarian Compute and the AltGRC demonstration platform.">
  <section class="outreach-hero">
    <div class="shell outreach-hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Independent venture development · Wales</p><h1>Building businesses around problems worth solving.</h1><p class="lead">A home for researching, testing and piloting ideas—with the aim of building viable, independent businesses.</p><a class="button" href="/compute/">Explore Tarian Compute <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <Network />
    </div>
    <div class="shell hero-note"><span>Our current focus</span><a href="/compute/">Exploring the conditions for UK AI infrastructure <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section shell">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Work in progress</p><h2>Ideas being put to the test.</h2></div><p>Different opportunities. Different stages.<br />A shared commitment to understanding what works.</p></div>
    <div class="venture-list home-ventures">
      <section class="venture-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / AI infrastructure</p><h3>Tarian Compute</h3><p class="status">Research and early conversations</p></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Exploring the conditions for commercially viable UK compute infrastructure.</p><p>Our current work centres on power, connectivity, location and future demand. We are opening conversations with people who can help test the opportunity.</p><a class="text-link" href="/compute/">Explore the questions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
      <section class="venture-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Governance technology</p><h3>AltGRC</h3><p class="status">Demonstration stage</p></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Exploring a more connected way to understand governance, risk and resilience.</p><p>AltGRC has reached demonstration stage. It has not yet secured its first customer, and further development is required before customer deployment.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ventures/#altgrc">About the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section tint-section"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Founder-led</p><h2>Experience applied to new possibilities.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Tarian Ventures is led by Dan Winder, bringing experience across technology delivery, governance, data, digital risk and enterprise transformation.</p><p>That combination shapes the work: understanding a problem in its commercial and operational context, testing assumptions and developing practical responses.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/#founder">Meet the founder <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">How Tarian works</p><h2>Room to explore.<br />Discipline to decide.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Tarian provides the umbrella for early research, experimentation and pilots.</p><p>Where an idea proves viable, the intention is to establish it as a separate legal entity. Where the evidence does not support it, we change direction or stop.</p><a class="text-link" href="/approach/">Our approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="contact-band section"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start with a conversation</p><h2>What could your perspective unlock?</h2></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">We are particularly interested in conversations about power, connectivity, infrastructure delivery and compute demand.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#compute">Discuss Tarian Compute <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
